  <div class="prose">
    <h1>FxTune Brand Guidelines</h1>

    <h2>Brand Identity</h2>
    <p>
      FxTune is a platinum-grade audio production suite inspired by legendary studio hardware: SSL
      Consoles, Neve 8078, Universal Audio, and Manley Labs. The visual language communicates
      precision, power, and professional-grade audio mastering.
    </p>
    <p><strong>Tagline:</strong> Platinum Studio Audio Production</p>

    <h2>Logo Usage</h2>
    <p>
      The FxTune logo consists of a gradient background with waveform-inspired typography. Available
      in PNG (raster) and XML Vector formats.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Maintain minimum clear space equal to the height of the "F" character</li>
      <li>Digital minimum: 32px height</li>
      <li>Print minimum: 10mm height</li>
      <li>Never stretch, distort, change colors, rotate, or add effects</li>
    </ul>

