    <h2>Typography</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Primary:</strong> System default (Roboto on Android, SF Pro on iOS, Segoe UI on Windows)
      </li>
      <li><strong>Monospace:</strong> For audio data, timecodes, and technical readouts</li>
      <li><strong>Display:</strong> Bold weight for headlines and hero text</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Tone and Messaging</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Professional:</strong> Speaks like a mastering engineer, not a consumer app</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Technical:</strong> Uses precise audio terminology (LUFS, crest factor, transient punch)
      </li>
      <li><strong>Confident:</strong> Assured in capabilities without arrogance</li>
      <li><strong>Innovative:</strong> Forward-looking, AI-powered, cutting-edge</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Key Messages</h3>
    <ol>
      <li>
        <strong>Precision Audio Production</strong> — Platinum-grade mastering tools in your pocket
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>AI-Powered Intelligence</strong> — Neural analysis and coaching that adapts to your style
      </li>
      <li><strong>Studio Heritage</strong> — Inspired by the world's most legendary consoles</li>
      <li><strong>Real-Time Performance</strong> — Sub-10ms latency, 60fps visualizers</li>
      <li><strong>Collaborative</strong> — Cloud sync, shared sessions, community leaderboards</li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Visual Style</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Dark-first:</strong> Deep space black backgrounds with luminous accents</li>
      <li><strong>Hardware-inspired:</strong> Metallic textures, knob-like controls, VU meters</li>
      <li><strong>Depth:</strong> Layered surfaces with subtle elevation and glass morphism</li>
      <li><strong>Motion:</strong> Smooth 60fps animations, no jank, purposeful transitions</li>
    </ul>

